<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - Lightersgames</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-deep: #060a10;
            --bg-elevated: #0f1419;
            --text-primary: #e4eaf0;
            --text-secondary: #a8b0ba;
            --accent-gold: #6ec0e8;
            --accent-gold-dim: rgba(110, 192, 232, 0.1);
            --border-color: rgba(228, 234, 240, 0.1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-deep);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            background-color: rgba(15, 20, 25, 0.5);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .nav-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .nav-logo {
            height: 32px;
            width: auto;
        }

        .nav-company {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .nav-back {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .nav-back:hover {
            opacity: 0.8;
            transform: translateX(-4px);
        }

        /* Main Content */
        main {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
        }

        .page-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .last-updated {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        section {
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent-gold-dim);
        }

        .section-content {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .section-content p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .section-content ul {
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .section-content li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .contact-info {
            background-color: var(--bg-elevated);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .contact-info p {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .contact-info strong {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Tables */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-elevated);
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        thead {
            background-color: rgba(110, 192, 232, 0.1);
        }

        th {
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        td {
            padding: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        tbody tr:hover {
            background-color: rgba(110, 192, 232, 0.05);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: rgba(15, 20, 25, 0.5);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .footer-content {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .footer-logo {
            height: 24px;
            width: auto;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        .footer-copyright {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 2rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav {
                padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

            .nav-left {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .nav-back {
                width: 100%;
            }

            main {
                padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            }

            .page-title {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 1.25rem;
            }

            table {
                font-size: 0.85rem;
            }

            th, td {
                padding: 0.75rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="nav-left">
            <img src="/img/logo-lightersgames-white.png" alt="Lightersgames" class="nav-logo">
            <span class="nav-company">Co., Ltd.</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/" class="nav-back">← Back to Home</a>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last updated: 2025/6/27</p>

        <div class="contact-info">
            <p><strong>Lightersgames Co., Ltd.</strong></p>
            <p>Address: 923, 54, Changeop-ro, Sujeong-gu, Seongnamsi, Gyeonggi-do, Republic of Korea</p>
            <p>Email: <span class="email-protect" data-user="hb" data-domain="lightersgames.com">[enable JS]</span></p>
        </div>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">Who We Are</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Lightersgames Co., Ltd. is an indie game studio dedicated to creating innovative and engaging gaming experiences. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit our website, use our games, or interact with our services.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">Information We Collect</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Type of Information</th>
                            <th>Collection Method</th>
                            <th>Purpose</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Account Information</td>
                            <td>User registration, profile setup</td>
                            <td>Account creation, authentication, personalization</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Contact Information</td>
                            <td>Contact forms, email submissions</td>
                            <td>Communication, support, feedback</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Game Data</td>
                            <td>In-game activity, gameplay tracking</td>
                            <td>Game functionality, progress tracking, analytics</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Device & Browser Data</td>
                            <td>Automatic collection via cookies, logs</td>
                            <td>Site optimization, security, analytics</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Usage Information</td>
                            <td>Web analytics tools</td>
                            <td>Understanding user behavior, improving services</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Location Data</td>
                            <td>IP address, browser language settings</td>
                            <td>Localization, fraud prevention</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>To provide, maintain, and improve our website and game services</li>
                    <li>To authenticate users and maintain account security</li>
                    <li>To respond to customer inquiries and provide support</li>
                    <li>To send updates, newsletters, and promotional content (with your consent)</li>
                    <li>To analyze usage patterns and improve user experience</li>
                    <li>To detect, prevent, and address fraud and security issues</li>
                    <li>To comply with legal obligations and enforce our Terms of Service</li>
                    <li>To personalize content and recommendations</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">Data Retention</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy, or as required by law. When your information is no longer needed, we securely delete or anonymize it. Account data may be retained for the duration of your account, and you may request deletion at any time by contacting us.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">Third-Party Services</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>We may share your information with third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website and conducting our business. These services include:</p>
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Service</th>
                            <th>Purpose</th>
                            <th>Data Shared</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Payment Processors</td>
                            <td>Processing game purchases and transactions</td>
                            <td>Payment information, purchase history</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Analytics Platforms</td>
                            <td>Understanding site usage and user behavior</td>
                            <td>Anonymous usage data, device info</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>CDN Services</td>
                            <td>Content delivery and site performance</td>
                            <td>IP address, browser information</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Email Service Providers</td>
                            <td>Sending newsletters and communications</td>
                            <td>Email address, communication preferences</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Cloud Storage</td>
                            <td>Data backup and game file storage</td>
                            <td>Account data, game saves, user files</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">Children's Privacy</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Our website and services are not directed to children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware that we have collected such information, we will delete it promptly. Parents or guardians who believe their child has provided information to us should contact us immediately.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">Your Rights</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Right to Access:</strong> You can request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</li>
                    <li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> You can request corrections to inaccurate data</li>
                    <li><strong>Right to Erasure:</strong> You can request deletion of your data (right to be forgotten)</li>
                    <li><strong>Right to Restrict Processing:</strong> You can request limitation on how we use your data</li>
                    <li><strong>Right to Data Portability:</strong> You can request your data in a portable format</li>
                    <li><strong>Right to Object:</strong> You can object to certain processing of your data</li>
                    <li><strong>Right to Withdraw Consent:</strong> You can withdraw consent for marketing communications at any time</li>
                </ul>
                <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <span class="email-protect" data-user="hb" data-domain="lightersgames.com">[enable JS]</span></p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">Security Measures</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information, including:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>HTTPS encryption for all data transmission</li>
                    <li>Secure password hashing and authentication protocols</li>
                    <li>Regular security audits and vulnerability assessments</li>
                    <li>Access controls and data minimization practices</li>
                    <li>Secure data storage and backup procedures</li>
                    <li>Employee privacy training and confidentiality agreements</li>
                </ul>
                <p>However, no security measure is 100% secure. While we strive to protect your information, we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">International Data Transfers</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Lightersgames Co., Ltd. is located in the Republic of Korea. If you access our services from outside Korea, your information may be transferred to, stored in, and processed in Korea. By using our services, you consent to the transfer of your information to countries outside your country of residence, which may have different data protection laws than your home country.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, technology, legal requirements, or other factors. We will notify you of any material changes by posting the updated policy on our website and updating the "Last Updated" date. Your continued use of our services following the posting of changes constitutes your acceptance of those changes.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">Contact Us</h2>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your personal information, please contact us:</p>
                <div class="contact-info" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
                    <p><strong>Lightersgames Co., Ltd.</strong></p>
                    <p>Address: 923, 54, Changeop-ro, Sujeong-gu, Seongnamsi, Gyeonggi-do, Republic of Korea</p>
                    <p>Email: <span class="email-protect" data-user="hb" data-domain="lightersgames.com">[enable JS]</span></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-content">
            <img src="/img/logo-lightersgames-white.png" alt="Lightersgames" class="footer-logo">
            <div class="footer-copyright">© 2025-2026 Lightersgames Co., Ltd.</div>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
                <a href="mailto:hb@lightersgames.com">Contact</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script is:inline>
        // Email protection
        document.querySelectorAll('.email-protect').forEach(el => {
            const user = el.getAttribute('data-user');
            const domain = el.getAttribute('data-domain');
            el.innerHTML = `<a href="mailto:${user}@${domain}">${user}@${domain}</a>`;
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
